\ A brace's reading error end to end (plan row TB2, blocks slice 1): } with
\ no brace open is 83, LeanForth's own (Lean's parser: unexpected token).
\ A text stops at its first error, so the other reading errors of braces
\ (by-end in a brace, { open at end, { as a name, | in a brace, ...) are
\ test.fs's, one text each.
theorem e_brace_stray
  Nat explicit: a  Nat explicit: b
  a b = explicit: h
  a b =
:= by
  ' h by-exact }
end e_brace_stray
